'''Eric Schussler''' is an American voice actor for the English-language [[dub]] of {{aniseries|PTS}}.

==Pokémon roles==
Schussler joined {{aniseries|PTS}} when [[The Pokémon Company International|Pokémon USA]] took over the dubbing and distribution of the series. He continued voicing until the end of season 10.
